-- title:
--   Original physical compensated cash excess has local L1 decay and uniform BV localisation tail
-- statement:
--   For the same original X,D and canonical uniform physical grid, find cofinal compact reserve bands, measurable exhausting events and a finite BV drift-envelope constant. The exact intrinsic compensated jump excess over strictly pre-ruin cash plus surviving horizon terminal converges locally in L1, and its off-event positive part is dominated by the original finite-variation path envelope. The Proved BV-ERROR7 exhaustion theorem then yields the full positive-error limit, with no new external assumptions.
